WEBVTT

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:03.940
Takemikazuchi!

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:08.360
Utao-chan!

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:09.190
No, it's not!

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:15.980
<i>Who is that?</i>

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:18.700
Kyohei!

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:21.200
Utao-chan?

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:23.910
Who are you?

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:26.920
That's not very nice of you to say,

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.130
Brother.

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:32.050
W... What?

00:00:32.350 --> 00:00:36.010
Get away from him!

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:40.520
Utao-chan!

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:40.520
Utao!

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:41.940
And you two stop being so close!

00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:47.020
Anyway, who is he?

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:50.770
I don't know, either.

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:29.830
Those kids are really going at it...

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:34.000
That's some real damage they're doing.

00:02:34.690 --> 00:02:37.460
Stupid kids, this isn't some playground.

00:02:38.190 --> 00:02:41.090
Can't you think of the guy 
who has to pick up after you?

00:02:46.240 --> 00:02:46.930
What?

00:02:51.670 --> 00:02:52.690
What is that?

00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:56.280
What are you doing?

00:02:56.280 --> 00:02:57.280
Hide it!

00:02:57.920 --> 00:02:59.900
Don't bring it out, on a big road like this!

00:03:00.390 --> 00:03:01.820
That's...

00:03:01.820 --> 00:03:03.970
the witness to that massacre.

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:05.660
Why is he here?

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:08.700
<b>Episode 5</b>

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:08.700
<b>To Home...</b>

00:03:14.990 --> 00:03:15.960
Kukuri!

00:03:15.960 --> 00:03:18.130
You idiot! Calm down!

00:03:37.590 --> 00:03:39.780
You really think you can get away?

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:49.500
Is he related to Utao-chan?

00:03:50.820 --> 00:03:53.000
I don't know right now.

00:03:53.510 --> 00:03:54.710
Kyohei...

00:03:55.070 --> 00:03:58.710
Even Kukuri can't keep taking hits from that lightning.

00:03:58.710 --> 00:04:00.850
Oh, right! I've got a weapon, too!

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:03.710
You dummy! The knife's on the right!

00:04:04.270 --> 00:04:05.040
U... uhm...

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:06.720
The hand you hold chopsticks with!

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:07.970
Here!

00:04:09.010 --> 00:04:12.210
But even so, our only weapon is a knife.

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:15.690
He's got that lightning he can use from range,

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:17.900
and that big arm for up close.

00:04:18.350 --> 00:04:20.570
I have a ranged attack, too.

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:22.080
That eye blast...

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:24.990
That would take too long for you to use right now.

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:28.240
He won't wait for it.

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:31.750
That's why we're trying to sneak up on him.

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:36.500
Can you see him?

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:37.780
Shut up!

00:04:38.430 --> 00:04:40.380
Concentrate... Concentrate...

00:04:42.940 --> 00:04:44.380
<i>But...</i>

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:49.140
<i>Is he really Utao's twin?</i>

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:52.390
<i>If he's the Takemikazuchi's Seki,</i>

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:54.990
<i>is he with the Hyuga?</i>

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:03.360
Now!

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:28.930
I saw some light.

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:30.140
This is amazing!

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:31.520
Kukuri!

00:05:31.520 --> 00:05:34.140
We don't want people to think 
we have anything to do with this!

00:05:34.140 --> 00:05:35.450
I heard there was an explosion!

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:36.620
Are they shooting a TV show?

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:37.960
It's over there!

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:39.020
Kuga-kun?

00:05:39.600 --> 00:05:41.900
Let's keep hiding among these people.

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:44.860
If we can make Kukuri disappear...

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:48.510
Kukuri's hand...

00:05:54.380 --> 00:05:55.120
You idiot!

00:05:59.720 --> 00:06:02.090
You've gotten pretty good at dodging.

00:06:13.870 --> 00:06:14.830
She's...

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:18.440
I was only planning to check her out today.

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:39.860
Damn it!

00:06:39.860 --> 00:06:42.460
Utao, hide Kukuri in the forest!

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:43.250
Quickly!

00:06:57.910 --> 00:06:59.080
Kukuri!

00:06:59.080 --> 00:06:59.920
Utao!

00:07:01.580 --> 00:07:03.000
It's fine to try something crazy,

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:04.020
but do a better job!

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:07.990
Rushing will just get Kukuri destroyed!

00:07:08.330 --> 00:07:09.400
Kukuri...

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:12.490
Kukuri destroyed...

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:14.950
Kukuri...

00:07:15.760 --> 00:07:17.210
What's wrong with you, Kuga-kun?

00:07:17.210 --> 00:07:18.580
Don't just yell at her.

00:07:19.140 --> 00:07:21.580
Utao-chan's frightened.

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:23.520
Utao-chan...

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:25.090
I...

00:07:25.780 --> 00:07:28.410
I... I'm going to destroy Kukuri.

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:30.760
I...

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:33.970
Calm down.

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:35.600
Kukuri's okay...

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:37.350
It's okay.

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:45.360
Stop crying.

00:07:45.930 --> 00:07:48.000
You're Kukuri's Seki.

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:51.490
You decide whether it lives or dies.

00:07:53.630 --> 00:07:55.180
Calm down.

00:07:55.180 --> 00:07:57.050
We'll hide Kukuri and run.

00:07:57.050 --> 00:07:58.410
I don't think so.

00:08:01.110 --> 00:08:03.920
What do you think you're doing?

00:08:04.430 --> 00:08:07.800
Utao was the one who started it.

00:08:08.660 --> 00:08:09.900
Did you?

00:08:11.410 --> 00:08:13.870
Even so, if you're that good,

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:15.800
you could have held back!

00:08:16.190 --> 00:08:19.520
I don't think it's my fault 
it was getting broken so easily...

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:21.200
Utao...

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:24.590
You're not cut out to be a Seki, are you?

00:08:26.780 --> 00:08:28.450
No one's asking you.

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:30.900
In any case, we lost.

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:32.370
Aren't you satisfied?

00:08:32.710 --> 00:08:37.370
Hmm... I only meant to tease her today.

00:08:39.390 --> 00:08:40.950
But I changed my mind.

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:44.840
Utao! Hide Kukuri now!

00:08:45.820 --> 00:08:47.250
Too late.

00:08:50.100 --> 00:08:51.460
Don't!

00:09:03.830 --> 00:09:05.500
What is this?...

00:09:11.520 --> 00:09:13.110
It's absorbing it?

00:09:28.080 --> 00:09:29.470
It fell in the lake!

00:09:29.470 --> 00:09:30.720
Let's go see.

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:32.800
What's going on?

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:37.810
Did we win?

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:39.300
Amazing, Utao-chan!

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:43.060
Did I do that?

00:09:43.740 --> 00:09:47.810
Takemikazuchi...

00:09:48.260 --> 00:09:50.610
Now, will you tell us?

00:09:52.440 --> 00:09:56.990
Are you really Utao's... My...

00:10:06.030 --> 00:10:07.350
Koushiro!

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:10.080
What are you doing here?

00:10:10.080 --> 00:10:13.590
Look at you... You're pathetic.

00:10:15.150 --> 00:10:18.340
We're here to catch Aki.

00:10:18.690 --> 00:10:21.610
You started out playing with her.

00:10:21.610 --> 00:10:24.850
And then you got angry and lost control.

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:30.980
You're just like them. You always lose your head.

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:36.990
Koushiro... Is he really...

00:10:57.010 --> 00:10:59.040
And when you pull it...

00:11:01.290 --> 00:11:02.990
I see.

00:11:02.990 --> 00:11:06.270
So inside, it's like an old automaton.

00:11:06.530 --> 00:11:09.610
The technology must have been 
really advanced, for the time.

00:11:09.610 --> 00:11:12.140
But the outside's only wood, isn't it?

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:16.360
But it was really flexible...

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:19.530
And how does it hear you

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:21.780
or fly?

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:23.770
I don't know.

00:11:33.520 --> 00:11:36.000
It's okay. It's okay.

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:37.410
It'll be fixed.

00:11:37.970 --> 00:11:41.760
That's why Kuga-kun is on the phone.

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:45.260
What's done is done, damn it!

00:11:45.820 --> 00:11:48.430
It wasn't just Utao's fault, anyway.

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:52.020
And who the hell is that Hyuga kid?

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:55.100
You don't know?

00:11:55.100 --> 00:11:57.270
You seriously expect me to believe that?!

00:12:05.020 --> 00:12:06.160
Damn it...

00:12:06.860 --> 00:12:08.450
Go back home?

00:12:08.450 --> 00:12:09.410
To the country?

00:12:09.920 --> 00:12:12.410
Yes, just for a while...

00:12:13.060 --> 00:12:16.650
The village is the only place that can repair a kakashi.

00:12:17.050 --> 00:12:18.110
I see...

00:12:19.460 --> 00:12:20.420
What about you?

00:12:23.730 --> 00:12:25.380
Don't worry.

00:12:25.380 --> 00:12:27.050
I'll go, too.

00:12:29.100 --> 00:12:30.520
I see.

00:12:30.520 --> 00:12:32.620
Well, I guess he doesn't have a choice.

00:12:33.380 --> 00:12:36.440
He said someone specializes in repairing kakashi?

00:12:36.840 --> 00:12:38.750
Oh, Utsuwashi?

00:12:39.790 --> 00:12:41.690
But what about school?

00:12:42.230 --> 00:12:44.440
It's almost summer break, anyway.

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:47.370
He'll still have to miss some classes.

00:12:47.570 --> 00:12:50.030
Either way...

00:12:51.590 --> 00:12:53.550
It might be for the best

00:12:53.550 --> 00:12:56.020
that she can't move her kakashi right now.

00:12:56.480 --> 00:13:00.460
<b>Mysterious objects 
in the Tokyo sky!?</b>

00:12:56.480 --> 00:13:00.460
<b>Suburban Oddities: 

00:12:56.480 --> 00:13:00.460
<b>UFO Expert</b>

00:12:56.760 --> 00:13:00.460
Anyone can take a video these days.

00:13:00.870 --> 00:13:03.890
See? It's visible clearly, right here.

00:13:03.890 --> 00:13:07.690
We'll just have to pray that nothing else gets out.

00:13:10.440 --> 00:13:11.450
Anyway...

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:13.320
Um...

00:13:14.070 --> 00:13:15.140
Dad...

00:13:15.670 --> 00:13:17.600
I want to ask you something.

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:23.190
Kyohei, are you mad...

00:13:24.790 --> 00:13:26.980
...that I broke Kukuri?

00:13:27.560 --> 00:13:30.080
That we have to go home?

00:13:30.990 --> 00:13:32.780
I'm not mad.

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:34.060
Not at you, anyway.

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:38.500
That boy...

00:13:39.730 --> 00:13:40.800
That boy...

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:43.010
Is he really our...

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:46.840
I don't know.

00:13:47.400 --> 00:13:51.170
Mom gave birth to you at the main family quarters.

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:53.780
I wasn't there.

00:13:56.070 --> 00:13:58.020
I'm scared, Kyohei.

00:14:01.830 --> 00:14:03.620
You're a totally different person

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:05.620
from the haughty little girl who arrived in Tokyo.

00:14:05.950 --> 00:14:06.610
Huh?

00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:12.330
I was thinking you'd actually grown up some...

00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:12.330
Shut up!

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:14.700
You must've worked really hard to put on that act.

00:14:15.150 --> 00:14:18.050
But it only lasted a night or so.

00:14:26.470 --> 00:14:28.840
<i>Koushiro... Is he really...</i>

00:14:29.320 --> 00:14:30.640
<i>Sorry.</i>

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:33.580
<i>I don't have permission to tell you that.</i>

00:14:33.990 --> 00:14:36.180
<i>Come on. Let's go.</i>

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:37.630
<i>Y-Yeah...</i>

00:14:54.480 --> 00:14:55.830
<i>I'm a moron...</i>

00:14:56.980 --> 00:14:59.340
<i>I fell for that stupid taunt.</i>

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:04.000
<i>Hibino-san was really freaked out.</i>

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:09.070
<i>Aki...</i>

00:15:09.570 --> 00:15:13.010
<i>What should we do?</i>

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:25.770
I'm sorry.

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:37.180
Hibino-san!

00:15:38.010 --> 00:15:40.100
Wh-What is it?

00:15:40.600 --> 00:15:41.870
Um...

00:15:42.230 --> 00:15:45.380
Would you let me go with you to the village?

00:15:58.430 --> 00:16:00.510
Um, Hibino-san?

00:16:00.510 --> 00:16:03.230
You can go a little faster.

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:06.730
I've never driven on a mountain road 
like this before...

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:10.240
I didn't know it would be 
this deep in the mountains.

00:16:10.710 --> 00:16:12.640
I'm sorry. It's really out in the country.

00:16:12.640 --> 00:16:15.070
No, that's not what I meant.

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:16.120
In front! In front!

00:16:23.970 --> 00:16:25.080
I'm sorry.

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:27.840
Let me concentrate on driving.

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:30.630
<i>We might be in trouble 
if an oncoming car shows up.</i>

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:39.260
I'm sorry.

00:16:39.260 --> 00:16:41.350
We'll pull over right away.

00:16:43.490 --> 00:16:45.270
Is that you, Kyohei?

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:50.530
What are you doing here?

00:16:57.040 --> 00:16:58.300
Utao-sama?

00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:03.290
You brought her back? Thanks.

00:17:03.720 --> 00:17:05.820
What are you doing?

00:17:05.820 --> 00:17:08.710
You left the village. It isn't your concern.

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:17.900
A friend?

00:17:17.900 --> 00:17:20.510
A classmate from high school.

00:17:21.960 --> 00:17:25.030
Utao-chan, you're "Utao-sama" here?

00:17:25.030 --> 00:17:25.880
What should I do?

00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:29.280
Should I call you that when we're in the village?

00:17:29.280 --> 00:17:31.980
No, you can just act normal.

00:17:32.520 --> 00:17:35.490
Were you "Kyohei-sama" back then?

00:17:35.860 --> 00:17:39.990
All that stopped the minute I quit being a Seki.

00:17:41.780 --> 00:17:44.000
I hate being called that.

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:48.500
Seems like it was really rough for you two.

00:17:54.070 --> 00:17:55.800
It's almost like a gate.

00:17:56.280 --> 00:17:58.840
It's the only entrance to the village.

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:00.720
It's really isolated, isn't it?

00:18:01.230 --> 00:18:02.480
It's pretty...

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:07.230
You can really believe that gods would live here.

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:11.450
<i>Gods live here, huh?</i>

00:18:14.550 --> 00:18:16.270
We're here.

00:18:16.980 --> 00:18:20.540
This is our village, Karakami Village.

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:40.140
You're back?

00:18:40.630 --> 00:18:41.760
Kirio...

00:18:55.590 --> 00:18:57.500
I'm disappointed in you.

00:18:57.500 --> 00:19:04.990
You damaged Takemikazuchi, 
in a pointless battle against the Kuga.

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:08.960
If you can't do what you're asked to,

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:11.210
maybe I should lock you up in the storeroom again.

00:19:12.620 --> 00:19:15.410
Give me one more chance...

00:19:15.410 --> 00:19:17.640
I'll catch Aki!

00:19:17.640 --> 00:19:18.300
So...

00:19:19.770 --> 00:19:22.300
You dare address me?

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:24.150
Know your place!

00:19:25.270 --> 00:19:26.930
Please...

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:31.690
Please... Just don't send me back there.

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:32.810
Shut up!

00:19:36.630 --> 00:19:39.010
That's enough.

00:19:39.010 --> 00:19:40.850
I'm disciplining him.

00:19:40.850 --> 00:19:44.740
I need to teach this naughty child a lesson.

00:19:45.170 --> 00:19:49.020
Then one hit, bare-handed, should do it.

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:53.440
I don't like watching people go too far.

00:19:58.270 --> 00:20:00.330
I'll take him.

00:20:00.710 --> 00:20:02.130
He's my partner.

00:20:04.020 --> 00:20:06.780
The mission to capture Aki is still on, right?

00:20:06.780 --> 00:20:09.890
Then he's still my partner.

00:20:11.470 --> 00:20:12.520
And...

00:20:13.630 --> 00:20:15.940
Something's been bothering me.

00:20:16.470 --> 00:20:19.900
You didn't release Aki, did you?

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:23.410
How stupid.

00:20:25.670 --> 00:20:27.050
I see.

00:20:27.050 --> 00:20:28.470
Fine, then.

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:31.410
I was just wondering.

00:20:35.970 --> 00:20:41.520
I raised that child in secret for twelve years.

00:20:41.520 --> 00:20:43.240
Perhaps it's time to say goodbye.

00:20:43.240 --> 00:20:46.550
Isn't it a bit soon to decide that?

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:57.280
Kirio-sama was fighting his first battle.

00:20:57.280 --> 00:20:59.530
He hasn't been a Seki long.

00:20:59.810 --> 00:21:04.120
Look how little his sister, Utao-sama, has progressed.

00:21:04.120 --> 00:21:07.240
You should be prepared for it to take some time.

00:21:07.980 --> 00:21:12.290
Lately, I have become doubtful...

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:16.260
About the event that caused everyone to think

00:21:16.260 --> 00:21:18.210
those two children were so important.

00:21:19.120 --> 00:21:22.540
You mean their being able to communicate with

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:26.260
the kakashi from within the womb, 
while Hitomi-san was pregnant?

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:28.900
This was taken as a sign

00:21:28.900 --> 00:21:33.310
that they were to be Seki above all other Seki.

00:21:33.990 --> 00:21:39.570
I believe that, perhaps, 
we were hasty in that conclusion.

00:21:40.040 --> 00:21:41.500
But either way,

00:21:41.500 --> 00:21:45.200
we must find a Seki

00:21:46.380 --> 00:21:52.450
powerful enough to control Amaterasu.

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:47.030
<b>Kamisama 
Dolls</b>

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:47.030
<b>Corner</b>

00:23:35.490 --> 00:23:37.290
Kamisama Dolls Corner!

00:23:37.290 --> 00:23:38.810
We continue to introduce the kakashi.

00:23:38.810 --> 00:23:40.080
This is Takemikazuchi.

00:23:39.460 --> 00:23:40.980
<b>Spark! 
Spark!</b>

00:23:40.080 --> 00:23:41.870
It uses lightning, it punches, it's strong,

00:23:41.600 --> 00:23:42.690
<b>Ow!</b>

